 checkout.
+# DSH integration patch: transcript delivery
+
+The pinned DSH deployment adds durable daemon transcript delivery. Failed message
+batches remain under `.transcript-outbox` in the configured workspace root and
+are retried after restart. Do not remove this directory during task cleanup.
+The local daemon health response exposes `transcript_pending_by_task` and
+`transcript_outbox_error`; execution completion alone does not prove transcript
+delivery completed. Public task messages preserve optional provider `call_id`.
+Messages without this field must not be paired by guessed invocation IDs.
